## 1. Personal use — FREE

You may use Inkception (the web app, the standalone HTML build, and the
offline ZIP) **for personal, non-commercial purposes** at no cost. This
includes editing your own photos, making collages, and exporting files for
your personal use.

## 2. Commercial use — REQUIRES A PAID LICENSE

Using Inkception **as part of a business or for commercial purposes**
requires a paid license from the author. Commercial purposes include, but
are not limited to:

- producing images/deliverables **for paying clients** (client work);
- selling products or services that were made with Inkception;
- using Inkception inside an organization as a shared tool.

A "Commercial License" can be purchased from the author (e.g. via the
Gumroad storefront) and grants the named buyer the right to use the software
for these purposes. The free personal version is NOT a commercial license.

